  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " appeared in lesson 02's ",
 StyleBox["fieldString",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " on strings; here it iterates an operator.)"
}], "Text",
